# This file is binary (PyTorch checkpoint) and cannot be represented as text.
# It contains the trained LinearProbe weights from the T010 pipeline.
# The file is created by running: python code/scripts/run_t010_adapter.py
# 
# Structure:
# - model_state_dict: State dictionary of the LinearProbe
# - optimizer_state_dict: Optimizer state
# - epoch: Final epoch number
# - training_metrics: Dict with train_losses, val_losses, train_accuracies, val_accuracies
# - input_dim: Input feature dimension (512)
# - output_dim: Output action dimension (6)
#
# This placeholder indicates the file should be generated by the script.
# In a real execution, this would be binary data.